*.log
*.mp4
generated/

# Derived from `gh issue list` by scripts/agent-issue-index.py --refresh.
# Untracked on purpose: a tracked index is a surface every PR writes (#2290).
.agents/issue-index.generated.md

# Pull-request body drafts. `d8b7ddc26` untracked these behind a per-worktree
# `.git/info/exclude`, which is NOT shared, and the very next commit
# (`651994a03`) re-added all three from another worktree. The ignore has to be
# tracked to hold. Write a PR body OUTSIDE the repository.
.prbody/
